{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_2001_p", "source_sha256": "3ab974f0d87aa8027a5f783392371bd2d5153e3d93d4e18a38d935dd5c302e14", "ja": "収録お疲れさま、響。\nずいぶん楽しそうだったじゃないか。", "zh": "录影辛苦了，响。\n你看起来挺开心的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_2002_013hib", "source_sha256": "a25d8f9846e97682e59b264d0bb7a5bfed05368299986924068c8faec452e79c", "ja": "うんっ！　いろんな動物と遊べたからね！\nこの動物園の子達みんなと仲良くなれたぞっ！", "zh": "嗯！因为本人和好多种动物玩耍了！\n这个动物园的孩子们跟本人都处得很好喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_2003_013hib", "source_sha256": "fd7fc037a705afb59a0ab1b77637d550215977e50e67ba1eeb0bf62f36cda675", "ja": "クマ江とライ蔵は「また遊びに来てね」って\n言ってくれたし。ゴリ奈とは、もう親友さ～！", "zh": "熊江和狮藏叫本人「下次再来玩呢」，\n本人跟猩奈也已经是好朋友啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_2004_p", "source_sha256": "9e99eb57f98176948fe6f2bac721b56d7bfb9d1f077a4e6965ecf04743bf22ac", "ja": "よかったな……。\n誰が何かは、あえて聞かないけど。", "zh": "太好了……\n我就刻意不问你谁是谁了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_2005_013hib", "source_sha256": "1c5c7336c47c95cccdaaa802e81a5161aed47de7d07346ac12d6b1d4e0c82159", "ja": "そうだっ！　今度のお休み、\n劇場のみんなと一緒に遊びにこようっと！", "zh": "对了！下次的休假，\n和剧场的大家一起来这玩吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_2006_013hib", "source_sha256": "a0373efd25edfb18edb63a86e18d71b2b52d7dc0eb26e01d1c221f16cbd3ccc7", "ja": "きっとみんな、すぐに仲良くなれるぞ～。\nあ、まずは{$P$}に紹介するね！", "zh": "大家一定也马上就会和动物们打成一片喔～\n啊，本人会先帮{$P$}介绍的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
